# Flask UDP App (Homework)

## 📌 Description
This project implements a simple web application using Flask and a UDP socket server.

Flow:
Browser form → Flask → UDP socket → server → JSON file (`storage/data.json`)

Each message is saved with a timestamp as a key.

---

## 🚀 Run locally (Poetry)

Install dependencies:

```bash
poetry install

---
## Run with Docker

Build Docker image:

```bash
docker build -t flask-app .

Run container with volume:

# Mac / Linux
docker run -p 3000:3000 -v $(pwd)/storage:/app/storage flask-app

# Windows
docker run -p 3000:3000 -v %cd%/storage:/app/storage flask-app